## the size trend, which is the disputed claim
   Pletenev et al.: larger models correlate MORE strongly.

    params model           |r| PPL    AUROC  within-form
        4B qwen3_4b_it       0.147   0.5857       0.5806
       20B gptoss_20b        0.175   0.3964       0.4147
       27B qwen35_27b        0.181   0.6083       0.5847
       27B qwen36_27b        0.114   0.5711       0.5471
       27B qwen38_27b        0.223   0.6295       0.5986
       35B qwen36_35b        0.190   0.5839       0.5658

   mean within-form AUROC, <=10B: 0.5806  (1 models)
   mean within-form AUROC, >=20B: 0.5422  (5 models)
   difference (large - small):    -0.0384
   positive supports their trend; negative supports B11-Y.
